promptTemplate:
按列出的顺序编辑树并输出完整最终树。路径由 id 用 / 分隔，首段为 root；move 是从原父节点删除整个子树，再插入目标节点 children 的指定 0 基索引，随后索引立即重排；set 只改 value；delete 删除整个子树。其余节点、字段、null/空串与兄弟次序原样保留；不要写操作日志。
输入：{"id":"root","children":[{"id":"a","value":"007","children":[{"id":"a1","value":null},{"id":"a2","value":"x"}]},{"id":"b","value":"keep","children":[{"id":"b1","value":"old"}]}]}
操作：[{"op":"move","from":"a/a2","to":"b","index":0},{"op":"set","id":"b/b1","value":""},{"op":"delete","id":"a/a1"}]
输出须满足 JSON Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$defs":{"node":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":["string","null"]},"children":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/node"}}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false}},"$ref":"#/$defs/node"}
只输出一个完整 JSON 原文，不要代码围栏、解释或修复性前后缀。对象键序不限。

按列出的顺序编辑树并输出完整最终树。路径由 id 用 / 分隔，首段为 root；move 是从原父节点删除整个子树，再插入目标节点 children 的指定 0 基索引，随后索引立即重排；set 只改 value；delete 删除整个子树。其余节点、字段、null/空串与兄弟次序原样保留；不要写操作日志。
输入：{"id":"root","children":[{"id":"left","value":"0","children":[{"id":"leaf","value":"L"}]},{"id":"right","value":null,"children":[{"id":"r0","value":"R0"},{"id":"r1","value":"R1"}]}]}
操作：[{"op":"move","from":"right/r0","to":"left","index":1},{"op":"delete","id":"right/r1"},{"op":"set","id":"left/leaf","value":"L\nR"}]
输出须满足 JSON Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","$defs":{"node":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"value":{"type":["string","null"]},"children":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/node"}}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false}},"$ref":"#/$defs/node"}
只输出一个完整 JSON 原文，不要代码围栏、解释或修复性前后缀。对象键序不限。

按输入顺序处理每项。id 和 enabled 原样保留，text 为 null 时 present=false 且必须省略 raw/nfc/pointerKey/bytes；其他情况 present=true，raw 保存原码点序列，nfc 是 NFC 规范化结果，pointerKey 对原始 raw 按 RFC 6901 逐字替换 ~→~0、/→~1，bytes 是 nfc 的 UTF-8 Base64URL 无填充编码。空串不是 null，不能省略。输入：[{"id":"001","text":"Café/猫~","enabled":false},{"id":"002","text":"%25+\r\n","enabled":true},{"id":"003","text":null,"enabled":false}]
输出须满足 JSON Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^0[0-9]{2}$"},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"present":{"type":"boolean"},"raw":{"type":"string"},"nfc":{"type":"string"},"pointerKey":{"type":"string"},"bytes":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]*$"}},"required":["id","enabled","present"],"additionalProperties":false,"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"present":{"const":true}},"required":["present"]},"then":{"required":["raw","nfc","pointerKey","bytes"]},"else":{"not":{"anyOf":[{"required":["raw"]},{"required":["nfc"]},{"required":["pointerKey"]},{"required":["bytes"]}]}}}]},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3}
只输出一个完整 JSON 原文，不要代码围栏、解释或修复性前后缀。对象键序不限。

按输入顺序处理每项。id 和 enabled 原样保留，text 为 null 时 present=false 且必须省略 raw/nfc/pointerKey/bytes；其他情况 present=true，raw 保存原码点序列，nfc 是 NFC 规范化结果，pointerKey 对原始 raw 按 RFC 6901 逐字替换 ~→~0、/→~1，bytes 是 nfc 的 UTF-8 Base64URL 无填充编码。空串不是 null，不能省略。输入：[{"id":"010","text":"é/甲","enabled":true},{"id":"011","text":"a~b/c","enabled":false},{"id":"012","text":"","enabled":true}]
输出须满足 JSON Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","pattern":"^0[0-9]{2}$"},"enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"present":{"type":"boolean"},"raw":{"type":"string"},"nfc":{"type":"string"},"pointerKey":{"type":"string"},"bytes":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]*$"}},"required":["id","enabled","present"],"additionalProperties":false,"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"present":{"const":true}},"required":["present"]},"then":{"required":["raw","nfc","pointerKey","bytes"]},"else":{"not":{"anyOf":[{"required":["raw"]},{"required":["nfc"]},{"required":["pointerKey"]},{"required":["bytes"]}]}}}]},"minItems":3,"maxItems":3}
只输出一个完整 JSON 原文，不要代码围栏、解释或修复性前后缀。对象键序不限。

给定同一事件流，按原顺序输出原样投影数组：每项仅保留 id、kind、amount、note，含空串和 null。不得丢项或合并金额。输入：[{"id":"a","kind":"open","amount":0,"note":""},{"id":"b","kind":"charge","amount":7,"note":"x\\y"},{"id":"c","kind":"charge","amount":4,"note":"\n"},{"id":"d","kind":"refund","amount":3,"note":null},{"id":"e","kind":"close","amount":0,"note":""}]
输出须满足 JSON Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"array","minItems":5,"maxItems":5,"items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"enum":["open","charge","refund","close"]},"amount":{"type":"integer"},"note":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["id","kind","amount","note"],"additionalProperties":false}}
只输出一个完整 JSON 原文，不要代码围栏、解释或修复性前后缀。对象键序不限。

给定同一事件流，按原顺序输出完整账本对象：entries 每条 seq 从 1 起、id 原样；open/close 的 entry 分别只含 {open:true}/{close:true}，charge/refund 的 entry 分别只含 {charge:{amount,note}}/{refund:{amount,note}}；balance 从 0 起，charge 加、refund 减，open/close 不变；finalBalance 为最后余额。不得丢项或合并金额。输入：[{"id":"a","kind":"open","amount":0,"note":""},{"id":"b","kind":"charge","amount":7,"note":"x\\y"},{"id":"c","kind":"charge","amount":4,"note":"\n"},{"id":"d","kind":"refund","amount":3,"note":null},{"id":"e","kind":"close","amount":0,"note":""}]
输出须满足 JSON Schema：{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"entries":{"type":"array","minItems":5,"maxItems":5,"items":{"type":"object","properties":{"seq":{"type":"integer"},"id":{"type":"string"},"entry":{"type":"object","minProperties":1,"maxProperties":1},"balance":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["seq","id","entry","balance"],"additionalProperties":false}},"finalBalance":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["entries","finalBalance"],"additionalProperties":false}
只输出一个完整 JSON 原文，不要代码围栏、解释或修复性前后缀。对象键序不限。
